OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 8 APR
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Gershwin
OL,5,     GDonald Macleod explores George
OL,6,     GGershwin's time in Paris in the
OL,7,     Gspring of 1928 and the music it
OL,8,     Ginspired.
OL,9,G1700FIn Tune
OL,10,     GPetroc Trelawny is joined by
OL,11,     Gcellists Julian Lloyd Webber and
OL,12,     GJiaxin Lloyd Webber, and pianist
OL,13,     GRebeca Omordia, as well as London
OL,14,     GSoundtrack Festival artistic
OL,15,     Gdirector Michael Beek.
OL,16,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,17,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,18,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
